orials\/SolarSystemAtlas","doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.ninety-minute.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/$volume","doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.ninety-minute.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/---2------------"],["doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.ninety-minute.documentation\/documentation\/SolarSystemAtlas"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"categoryPathComponent":"SolarSystemAtlas","title":"세션 2: 궤도선과 공전·자전 애니메이션 만들기","role":"project","category":"SolarSystemAtlas 90분 워크숍"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.ninety-minute.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas-90-----\/02-Animate-Orbits-and-Labels"},"sections":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"세션 1의 정적인 장면에 궤도 메시를 추가하고, 절대 시간을 공전 위치와 자전 각도로 변환하고, 행성 이름이 모델을 따라가도록 만듭니다."}]}],"chapter":"세션 2 · 궤도와 애니메이션","backgroundImage":"animation-data-flow.svg","title":"세션 2: 궤도선과 공전·자전 애니메이션 만들기","estimatedTimeInMinutes":30,"kind":"hero","image":"animation-data-flow.svg"},{"tasks":[{"stepsSection":[{"caption":[],"type":"step","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"파일 위쪽에 UIKit을 import합니다. 궤도 재질의 반투명 흰색을 만들 때 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIColor"},{"text":"를 사용합니다.","type":"text"}]}],"code":"04-Import-UIKit.swift","runtimePreview":null},{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"각 구간은 안쪽과 바깥쪽 정점 두 개를 만들고 두 삼각형으로 연결됩니다. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UnlitMaterial"},{"text":"은 주변 조명과 관계없이 궤도선을 일정한 밝기로 보여 줍니다.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"step","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"구조체 마지막에 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"makeOrbitRing"},{"text":"을 추가합니다.","type":"text"}]}],"code":"04-Orbit-Ring.swift","runtimePreview":null},{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"하나의 부모를 기울이면 여덟 궤도에 같은 회전을 반복해서 적용할 필요가 없습니다. 행성 위치 계산에도 같은 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tabletopTilt"},{"text":" 값을 사용해 선과 모델을 맞춥니다.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"step","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"addOrbitPlate"},{"text":"를 추가하고 RealityView 생성 클로저에서 태양보다 먼저 호출합니다.","type":"text"}]}],"code":"04-Add-Orbit-Plate.swift","runtimePreview":null},{"caption":[],"type":"step","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"앱을 실행해 여덟 개의 반투명 궤도선과 정지한 행성이 같은 경로 위에 놓이는지 확인합니다.","type":"text"}]}],"code":null,"runtimePreview":null}],"title":"0–10분: 여덟 개의 궤도선 만들기","anchor":"0-10분-여덟-개의-궤도선-만들기","contentSection":[{"mediaPosition":"trailing","media":"spatial-layout-rotation.svg","kind":"contentAndMedia","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"RealityKit 기본 도형에는 얇은 원형 띠가 없으므로 안쪽·바깥쪽 정점을 만들고 삼각형 인덱스로 연결합니다. 모든 궤도는 하나의 plate 아래에 넣어 같은 기울기를 공유합니다.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"stepsSection":[{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"생성 클로저는 엔티티를 한 번 만들고 update 클로저는 이미 있는 엔티티의 값만 바꿉니다. 매 프레임 모델을 다시 로딩하면 안 됩니다.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"step","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animationStartDate"},{"text":" 상태를 추가하고 기존 RealityView를 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimelineView(.animation)"},{"text":" 안으로 옮깁니다. 생성 클로저 뒤에는 update 클로저를 추가합니다.","type":"text"}]}],"code":"04-Timeline.swift","runtimePreview":null},{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"나머지를 주기로 나누면 진행률이 0에서 1 사이를 반복합니다. 한 바퀴는 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"2π"},{"text":" 라디안입니다.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"step","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"반복 진행률과 y축 회전을 만드는 두 함수를 구조체 마지막에 추가합니다.","type":"text"}]}],"code":"04-Cycle-Progress.swift","runtimePreview":null},{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"태양 엔티티의 이름으로 기존 모델을 찾아 방향만 바꿉니다.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"step","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"태양의 자전을 갱신하는 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"updateSun"},{"text":"을 추가합니다.","type":"text"}]}],"code":"04-Update-Sun.swift","runtimePreview":null},{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"orbitDuration"},{"text":"은 위치 변화 속도를, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rotationDuration"},{"text":"과 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rotationDirection"},{"text":"은 자전 속도와 방향을 결정합니다. 그래서 금성과 천왕성은 다른 행성과 반대 방향으로 회전할 수 있습니다.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"step","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"행성 하나의 공전 위치와 자전 방향을 계산하는 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"update"},{"text":"를 추가합니다.","type":"text"}]}],"code":"04-Update-Planet.swift","runtimePreview":null},{"caption":[],"type":"step","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"RealityView update 클로저에서 루트를 찾은 뒤 태양과 모든 행성의 update 함수를 호출합니다.","type":"text"}]}],"code":"04-Update-All.swift","runtimePreview":null}],"title":"10–22분: 시간 기반 공전과 자전 추가하기","anchor":"10-22분-시간-기반-공전과-자전-추가하기","contentSection":[{"mediaPosition":"trailing","media":"animation-data-flow.svg","kind":"contentAndMedia","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"프레임마다 각도를 조금씩 더하면 프레임 손실이 속도 차이로 누적됩니다. 시작 시각부터 흐른 시간을 주기로 나눈 진행률을 사용하면 같은 시각에는 항상 같은 위치가 계산됩니다.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"stepsSection":[{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"이 코드는 attachment 문법을 보여 주는 축약 예시입니다. 현재 파일의 RealityView에 같은 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"attachments:"},{"text":" 부분을 합치고 별도의 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PlanetLabelScene"},{"text":"은 만들지 않습니다.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"step","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"RealityView 생성 클로저가 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"attachments"},{"text":"를 받고, attachments 클로저에서 여덟 행성의 이름을 만듭니다.","type":"text"}]}],"code":"05-Attachments.swift","runtimePreview":null},{"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"레이블의 y 좌표는 행성 반지름과 0.018m 여백만큼 위로 올립니다.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"step","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"addPlanet"},{"text":"에 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RealityViewAttachments"},{"text":" 매개변수를 추가하고, 모델을 루트에 넣은 다음 해당 행성의 레이블 엔티티도 연결합니다.","type":"text"}]}],"code":"05-Connect-Label.swift","runtimePreview":null},{"caption":[],"type":"step","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"행성 update 함수 마지막에서 같은 각도로 레이블 위치도 갱신합니다.","type":"text"}]}],"code":"05-Update-Label.swift","runtimePreview":null},{"caption":[],"type":"step","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"세션 2 체크포인트에서 지금까지 작성한 파일 전체를 비교합니다. DocC는 세션 1에서 새로 추가된 줄을 강조합니다.","type":"text"}]}],"code":"90-Session2-Checkpoint.swift","runtimePreview":null},{"caption":[],"type":"step","media":null,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"앱을 실행합니다. 궤도선 위에서 행성이 서로 다른 속도로 공전·자전하고 각 이름이 모델 위를 따라가면 세션 2를 완료한 것입니다.","type":"text"}]}],"code":null,"runtimePreview":null}],"title":"22–30분: 행성 이름이 모델을 따라가게 만들기","anchor":"22-30분-행성-이름이-모델을-따라가게-만들기","contentSection":[{"mediaPosition":"trailing","media":"spatial-layout-overlay.svg","kind":"contentAndMedia","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"attachment는 SwiftUI 뷰를 RealityKit 엔티티로 사용할 수 있게 합니다. 텍스트는 SwiftUI로 스타일링하고 위치는 행성과 같은 수학으로 갱신합니다.","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"kind":"tasks"},{"action":{"type":"reference","overridingTitle":"Get started","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.ninety-minute.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas-90-----\/03-Add-Selection-and-Info-Card","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get started"}]},"title":"세션 3: 행성을 선택하고 도감 카드 보여 주기","abstract":[{"text":"움직이는 행성을 공간 입력 대상으로 만들고, 탭 결과를 SwiftUI 상태에 저장하고, 별도의 정보 카드와 접근성 처리를 연결해 앱을 완성합니다.","type":"text"}],"featuredEyebrow":"Tutorial","kind":"callToAction"}],"kind":"project","references":{"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.ninety-minute.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas-90-----/02-Animate-Orbits-and-Labels":{"kind":"project","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.ninety-minute.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas-90-----\/02-Animate-Orbits-and-Labels","role":"project","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"세션 1의 정적인 장면에 궤도 메시를 추가하고, 절대 시간을 공전 위치와 자전 각도로 변환하고, 행성 이름이 모델을 따라가도록 만듭니다."}],"url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas-90-----\/02-animate-orbits-and-labels","estimatedTime":"30min","title":"세션 2: 궤도선과 공전·자전 애니메이션 만들기"},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.ninety-minute.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas-90-----/01-Build-the-Solar-System-Scene":{"title":"세션 1: 태양과 여덟 행성을 공간에 배치하기","estimatedTime":"30min","type":"topic","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas-90-----\/01-build-the-solar-system-scene","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.ninety-minute.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas-90-----\/01-Build-the-Solar-System-Scene","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"프로젝트와 에셋의 연결을 확인하고, 행성 데이터를 작성하고, 서로 크기가 다른 3D 모델을 정규화해 정적인 태양계 장면을 만듭니다."}],"kind":"project","role":"project"},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.ninety-minute.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas-90-----/02-Animate-Orbits-and-Labels#10-22%EB%B6%84-%EC%8B%9C%EA%B0%84-%EA%B8%B0%EB%B0%98-%EA%B3%B5%EC%A0%84%EA%B3%BC-%EC%9E%90%EC%A0%84-%EC%B6%94%EA%B0%80%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0":{"title":"10–22분: 시간 기반 공전과 자전 추가하기","type":"section","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas-90-----\/02-animate-orbits-and-labels#10-22%EB%B6%84-%EC%8B%9C%EA%B0%84-%EA%B8%B0%EB%B0%98-%EA%B3%B5%EC%A0%84%EA%B3%BC-%EC%9E%90%EC%A0%84-%EC%B6%94%EA%B0%80%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.ninety-minute.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas-90-----\/02-Animate-Orbits-and-Labels#10-22%EB%B6%84-%EC%8B%9C%EA%B0%84-%EA%B8%B0%EB%B0%98-%EA%B3%B5%EC%A0%84%EA%B3%BC-%EC%9E%90%EC%A0%84-%EC%B6%94%EA%B0%80%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","abstract":[{"text":"세션 1의 정적인 장면에 궤도 메시를 추가하고, 절대 시간을 공전 위치와 자전 각도로 변환하고, 행성 이름이 모델을 따라가도록 만듭니다.","type":"text"}],"kind":"section","role":"pseudoSymbol"},"90-Session2-Checkpoint.swift":{"fileName":"SolarSystemAtlasView.swift — 세션 2 체크포인트","fileType":"","syntax":"","type":"file","identifier":"90-Session2-Checkpoint.swift","content":["\/\/","\/\/  SolarSystemAtlasView.swift","\/\/  SolarSystemAtlas","\/\/","\/\/  Created by Youngmin Cho on 8\/13\/26.","\/\/","","import SwiftUI","import RealityKit","import RealityKitContent","import UIKit","","struct SolarSystemAtlasView: View {","    private let pointToMeter: Float = 0.001","    private let sunDiameter: Float = 0.088","    private let sunRotationDuration: TimeInterval = 8","    private let tabletopTilt: Float = .pi \/ 10","","    @State private var animationStartDate = Date()","","    var body: some View {","        TimelineView(.animation) { timeline in","            let elapsedTime = max(","                0,","                timeline.date.timeIntervalSince(animationStartDate)","            )","","            ZStack(alignment: .trailing) {","                RealityView { content, attachments in","                    let root = Entity()","                    root.name = EntityName.root","                    content.add(root)","","                    addOrbitPlate(to: root)","                    await addSun(to: root)","","                    for (index, planet) in Planet.starter.enumerated() {","                        await addPlanet(","                            planet,","                            index: index,","                            to: root,","                            attachments: attachments","                        )","                    }","                } update: { content, _ in","                    guard let root = content.entities.first(where: {","                        $0.name == EntityName.root","                    }) else {","                        return","                    }","","                    updateSun(in: root, elapsedTime: elapsedTime)","","                    for (index, planet) in Planet.starter.enumerated() {","                        update(","                            planet,","                            index: index,","                            in: root,","                            elapsedTime: elapsedTime","                        )","                    }","                } attachments: {","                    ForEach(Planet.starter) { planet in","                        Attachment(id: planet.id) {","                            Text(planet.name)","                                .font(.caption2)","                                .padding(.horizontal, 6)","                                .padding(.vertical, 3)","                                .glassBackgroundEffect()","                        }","                    }","                }","            }","        }","    }","","    private func addOrbitPlate(to root: Entity) {","        let orbitPlate = Entity()","        orbitPlate.name = EntityName.orbitPlate","        orbitPlate.orientation = simd_quatf(","            angle: tabletopTilt,","            axis: SIMD3(1, 0, 0)","        )","        root.addChild(orbitPlate)","","        for planet in Planet.starter {","            let radius = Float(planet.orbitRadius) * pointToMeter","","            if let orbit = try? makeOrbitRing(radius: radius) {","                orbitPlate.addChild(orbit)","            }","        }","    }","","    private func addSun(to root: Entity) async {","        guard let sun = try? await fittedModel(","            named: \"Sun\",","            targetDiameter: sunDiameter","        ) else {","            return","        }","","        sun.name = EntityName.sun","        sun.position.y = sunDiameter \/ 2","        root.addChild(sun)","    }","","    private func addPlanet(","        _ planet: Planet,","        index: Int,","        to root: Entity,","        attachments: RealityViewAttachments","    ) async {","        guard let model = try? await fittedModel(","            named: planet.assetName,","            targetDiameter: Float(planet.displaySize) * pointToMeter","        ) else {","            return","        }","","        let diameter = Float(planet.displaySize) * pointToMeter","        let radius = Float(planet.orbitRadius) * pointToMeter","        let startAngle = Float(Double(index) * .pi \/ 4)","","        model.name = EntityName.model(planet)","        model.position = planetPosition(","            radius: radius,","            diameter: diameter,","            angle: startAngle","        )","        root.addChild(model)","","        if let label = attachments.entity(for: planet.id) {","            label.name = EntityName.label(planet)","            label.position = labelPosition(","                radius: radius,","                diameter: diameter,","                angle: startAngle","            )","            root.addChild(label)","        }","    }","","    private func updateSun(in root: Entity, elapsedTime: TimeInterval) {","        let progress = cycleProgress(","            elapsedTime,","            duration: sunRotationDuration","        )","        root.findEntity(named: EntityName.sun)?.orientation = rotation(","            radians: Float(progress * 2 * .pi)","        )","    }","","    private func update(","        _ planet: Planet,","        index: Int,","        in root: Entity,","        elapsedTime: TimeInterval","    ) {","        let orbitProgress = cycleProgress(","            elapsedTime,","            duration: planet.orbitDuration","        )","        let startOffset = Double(index) * .pi \/ 4","        let orbitAngle = startOffset + orbitProgress * 2 * .pi","","        let spinProgress = cycleProgress(","            elapsedTime,","            duration: planet.rotationDuration","        )","        let spinAngle = spinProgress * 2 * .pi * planet.rotationDirection","        let radius = Float(planet.orbitRadius) * pointToMeter","        let diameter = Float(planet.displaySize) * pointToMeter","        let angle = Float(orbitAngle)","","        if let model = root.findEntity(named: EntityName.model(planet)) {","            model.position = planetPosition(","                radius: radius,","                diameter: diameter,","                angle: angle","            )","            model.orientation = rotation(radians: Float(spinAngle))","        }","","        root.findEntity(named: EntityName.label(planet))?.position = labelPosition(","            radius: radius,","            diameter: diameter,","            angle: angle","        )","    }","","    private func planetPosition(","        radius: Float,","        diameter: Float,","        angle: Float","    ) -> SIMD3<Float> {","        let depth = sin(angle) * radius","        return SIMD3(","            cos(angle) * radius,","            diameter \/ 2 - depth * sin(tabletopTilt),","            depth * cos(tabletopTilt)","        )","    }","","    private func labelPosition(","        radius: Float,","        diameter: Float,","        angle: Float","    ) -> SIMD3<Float> {","        var position = planetPosition(","            radius: radius,","            diameter: diameter,","            angle: angle","        )","        position.y += diameter \/ 2 + 0.018","        return position","    }","","    private func fittedModel(","        named assetName: String,","        targetDiameter: Float","    ) async throws -> Entity {","        let source = try await Entity(","            named: assetName,","            in: realityKitContentBundle","        )","        let bounds = source.visualBounds(relativeTo: source)","        let largestDimension = max(","            bounds.extents.x,","            bounds.extents.y,","            bounds.extents.z","        )","        let scale = largestDimension > 0","            ? targetDiameter \/ largestDimension","            : 1","","        source.scale = SIMD3(repeating: scale)","        source.position = -bounds.center * scale","","        let container = Entity()","        container.addChild(source)","        return container","    }","","    private func makeOrbitRing(radius: Float) throws -> ModelEntity {","        let segments = 192","        let halfWidth: Float = 0.00075","        var positions: [SIMD3<Float>] = []","        var indices: [UInt32] = []","","        positions.reserveCapacity((segments + 1) * 2)","        indices.reserveCapacity(segments * 6)","","        for segment in 0...segments {","            let angle = Float(segment) \/ Float(segments) * 2 * .pi","            let direction = SIMD2<Float>(cos(angle), sin(angle))","            let inner = direction * (radius - halfWidth)","            let outer = direction * (radius + halfWidth)","","            positions.append(SIMD3(inner.x, 0, inner.y))","            positions.append(SIMD3(outer.x, 0, outer.y))","        }","","        for segment in 0..<segments {","            let inner = UInt32(segment * 2)","            let outer = inner + 1","            let nextInner = inner + 2","            let nextOuter = inner + 3","","            indices.append(contentsOf: [","                inner, outer, nextOuter,","                inner, nextOuter, nextInner","            ])","        }","","        var descriptor = MeshDescriptor(name: \"OrbitRing\")","        descriptor.positions = MeshBuffers.Positions(positions)","        descriptor.primitives = .triangles(indices)","","        let mesh = try MeshResource.generate(from: [descriptor])","        let color = UIColor.white.withAlphaComponent(0.28)","        var material = UnlitMaterial(color: color)","        material.faceCulling = .none","        return ModelEntity(mesh: mesh, materials: [material])","    }","","    private func cycleProgress(","        _ elapsedTime: TimeInterval,","        duration: TimeInterval","    ) -> Double {","        elapsedTime.truncatingRemainder(dividingBy: duration) \/ duration","    }","","    private func rotation(radians: Float) -> simd_quatf {","        simd_quatf(angle: radians, axis: SIMD3(0, 1, 0))","    }","","}","","private enum EntityName {","    static let root = \"solar-system-root\"","    static let sun = \"sun-model\"","    static let orbitPlate = \"orbit-plate\"","","    static func model(_ planet: Planet) -> String {","        \"model-\\(planet.id)\"","    }","","    static func label(_ planet: Planet) -> String {","        \"label-\\(planet.id)\"","    }","}"],"highlights":[{"line":1},{"line":2},{"line":3},{"line":4},{"line":5},{"line":6},{"line":7},{"line":11},{"line":16},{"line":18},{"line":19},{"line":22},{"line":23},{"line":24},{"line":25},{"line":26},{"line":28},{"line":29},{"line":30},{"line":31},{"line":32},{"line":34},{"line":35},{"line":36},{"line":37},{"line":38},{"line":39},{"line":40},{"line":41},{"line":42},{"line":43},{"line":44},{"line":45},{"line":46},{"line":47},{"line":48},{"line":49},{"line":50},{"line":51},{"line":52},{"line":53},{"line":54},{"line":55},{"line":56},{"line":57},{"line":58},{"line":59},{"line":60},{"line":61},{"line":62},{"line":63},{"line":64},{"line":65},{"line":66},{"line":67},{"line":68},{"line":69},{"line":70},{"line":71},{"line":72},{"line":73},{"line":74},{"line":75},{"line":76},{"line":77},{"line":78},{"line":79},{"line":80},{"line":81},{"line":82},{"line":83},{"line":84},{"line":85},{"line":86},{"line":87},{"line":88},{"line":89},{"line":90},{"line":103},{"line":111},{"line":112},{"line":116},{"line":121},{"line":123},{"line":125},{"line":129},{"line":132},{"line":133},{"line":134},{"line":135},{"line":136},{"line":137},{"line":138},{"line":139},{"line":140},{"line":141},{"line":142},{"line":143},{"line":144},{"line":145},{"line":146},{"line":147},{"line":148},{"line":149},{"line":150},{"line":151},{"line":152},{"line":153},{"line":154},{"line":155},{"line":156},{"line":157},{"line":158},{"line":159},{"line":160},{"line":161},{"line":162},{"line":163},{"line":164},{"line":165},{"lin